        "value": {
          "briefSummary": "The aim of the study is to evaluate the efficacy and safety of tralokinumab in adults with atopic dermatitis"
        },
        "ref": "ctg:NCT02347176:3e933eac56369196c45d59e3c20a96e61c92fe84e7b63de35821faaa4c2581f5#/protocolSection/descriptionModule",
        "source": {
